1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/qa/qa-how-to-deal-with-tech-anxiety-in-ai-era","children":["Q&A丨在 AI 时代，如何应对技术焦虑？"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/qa-how-to-deal-with-tech-anxiety-in-ai-era.jpg","alt":"Q&A丨在 AI 时代，如何应对技术焦虑？ 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"ai问答"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"Q&A丨在 AI 时代，如何应对技术焦虑？"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本文探讨了在 AI 时代如何应对技术焦虑的问题。通过分析底层技术学习的必要性，提出了\"原则重于工具\"的核心观点，并构建了包含 T 型知识结构、时间盒管理、即时学习等策略的系统性解决方案，帮助工程师在技术海洋中找到方向，从焦虑走向成长。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-06-21T03:06:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/06/21"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","8,461"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":"长期以来我一直陷于技术海洋之中无法自拔，各种追逐技术，有过偶尔的专注，也获得了很大的提升，但更多时候，还是处于多头乱撞、内耗焦虑当中。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在 AI 快速发展的这段时间，我的焦虑更甚，减法做得越来越差，所以最近专门跟 Google Gemini 聊了这个话题，我觉得它的回答非常好，解答了我很多的疑惑，也让我对未来有了更多的信心，特此整理此篇，以图内心获得更多的宁静。"}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"在-ai-时代还有必要学习底层技术吗","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#在-ai-时代还有必要学习底层技术吗","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#在-ai-时代还有必要学习底层技术吗"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"在 AI 时代，还有必要学习底层技术吗？","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":4,"offset":188},"end":{"line":5,"column":24,"offset":208}}}]},"children":"在 AI 时代，还有必要学习底层技术吗？"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["第一个问题我是跟 ChatGPT 讨论的：",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"/blog/qa/qa-should-learn-underlying-principles-in-ai-era/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/blog/qa/qa-should-learn-underlying-principles-in-ai-era/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"在 AI 时代，程序员还有必要学习底层技术吗？","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":23,"offset":232},"end":{"line":7,"column":46,"offset":255}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":22,"offset":231},"end":{"line":7,"column":106,"offset":315}}},"children":"在 AI 时代，程序员还有必要学习底层技术吗？"}]]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"它给了我 5 个直击内心的理由："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"抽象层终会\"泄露\"，底层知识是你的救生筏；"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"问题的根源，往往深藏于你看不到的地方；"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"真正的工程判断力，建立在对权衡的理解之上；"}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":"你的职业天花板，由底层知识决定；"}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":"创新，源于对第一性原理的掌握。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"我觉得非常有道理："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"当 AI 失灵或表现不佳时，能拯救你的不是另一个 AI，而是你对底层的掌控力。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"只懂“驾驶”的人在车坏了时只能打电话求助，而懂“机械”的人能自己打开发动机盖解决问题。我要做后者。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"AI 可以成为我的顾问，但最终做出决策、并为之负责的人是我。我的决策质量，直接取决于我的底层知识深度。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":"AI 会拉平初级和中级工程师的差距，但底层技术功底是区分高级/资深工程师与普通工程师的护城河。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":"学习底层技术，不仅是为了解决今天的问题，更是为了获得解决明天未知问题、甚至定义未来的能力。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":"所以在保持积极学习前沿技术的同时，我应当将更多的时间，有计划地、持续地加深我的纵向底层知识，从\"为什么会这样？\"开始，一路向下挖掘，直到触及问题的本质。"}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"如何应对技术焦虑","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#如何应对技术焦虑","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#如何应对技术焦虑"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"如何应对技术焦虑","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":4,"offset":792},"end":{"line":27,"column":12,"offset":800}}}]},"children":"如何应对技术焦虑"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-6",{"children":["第二个问题我是跟 Google Gemini 讨论的：",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://g.co/gemini/share/819b80654773","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://g.co/gemini/share/819b80654773"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"后端工程师如何应对技术焦虑","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":29,"offset":830},"end":{"line":29,"column":42,"offset":843}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":28,"offset":829},"end":{"line":29,"column":83,"offset":884}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"后端工程师如何应对技术焦虑"}],"。"]}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e"]}]}],"$L4f","$L50","$L51"]}],"$L52"]}]]}]}]
